# Single figures: the C3 Trace between U8 pin 11 and U7 pin 14 is cracked; U7's CKA floats high, so the
# tens never count and are cleared to 0 every cycle. U10 pin 13 stays on C3 and the units are right.
machine knob
title "Single figures"
brief "The left digit always shows 0, and the right digit goes round from 0 to 9 as the knob turns up."
fault crack U8.11 U7.14 50%
